<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44558" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐνομ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>good order</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθρώπων ὕβριν τε καὶ εὐνομίην
					ἐφορῶντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.487
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν εὐ. εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenoph.
					2.19
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετέβαλον ὧδε ἐς εὐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.65
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.124
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐνομίῃσι πόλιν κάτα . . κοιρανέουσ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Hom.</u>
					30.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				216b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόλεμος εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				5.67
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.195
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καίσαρος εὐ</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				236
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐνομίαν διὰ τῆς μουσικῆς εἰσδέχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					425a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔστι εὐνομία τὸ εὖ κεῖσθαι
					τοὺς νόμους, μὴ πείθεσθαι δέ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1294a3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1280b6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Def.</u>
				413e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐπὶ τῆς εὐνομίας</span>,
			title of officials in Crete, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5075.35
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Latos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>loyalty to divine law</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐνομίᾳ σέβων μεγίστᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					713
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			personified as daughter of Themis, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				902
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				9.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				12.186
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lyr.Adesp.</u>
				140.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.1598
			</span></i>; title of a poem by Tyrtaeus, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1307a1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.4.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>observance of the laws of art</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. μουσική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longus
					2.35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔνομος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>diligence in foraging</i>: metaph., of bees, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>; <i>regularity in pasturing</i>, of sheep, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				1.5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
